## Cross-cutting invariants

Rules **no feature may violate**, whoever implements it. Read this section
before every session; violating an invariant is a defect even when the
gate is green.

- {{INVARIANT_1}}
- {{INVARIANT_2}}

Good invariants are falsifiable and specific: a scoping rule every query
must honor, a queue's dedup key format, "the daily import updates and
never inserts". Where possible, enforce them in the gate too.

